<DESCRIPTION>PRESS RELEASE - UNIVERSE PHARMACEUTICALS INC ANNOUNCES SHARE CONSOLIDATION
<TEXT>
<HTML>
<HEAD>
     <TITLE></TITLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">

<P STYLE="text-align: right; margin: 0"><B>Exhibit 99.1</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center; background-color: white"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center; background-color: white"><B>Universe Pharmaceuticals
INC Announces Share Consolidation</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center; background-color: white"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">Jiangxi, China, July
27, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) &ndash; Universe Pharmaceuticals INC (NASDAQ: UPC) (&ldquo;Universe Pharmaceuticals&rdquo; or the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;),
a pharmaceutical producer and distributor in China, today announced that the Company plans to effect a share consolidation of six (6)
ordinary shares with par value of $0.003125 per share each in the Company&rsquo;s issued and unissued share capital into one (1) ordinary
share with par value of US$0.01875 (the &ldquo;Share Consolidation&rdquo;). As a result of the Share Consolidation, each six (6) pre-consolidation
ordinary shares outstanding will automatically combine and convert to one issued and outstanding ordinary share without any action on
the part of the shareholders.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">The Share Consolidation
will be effective at 5:00 p.m. Cayman Islands time on July 27, 2023. Beginning with the opening of trading on July 28, 2023, U.S. Eastern
time, the Company&rsquo;s ordinary shares will begin trading on a post-Share Consolidation basis on the Nasdaq Global Market under the
same symbol &ldquo;UPC&rdquo; but under a new CUSIP number of G9442G 112. No fractional shares will be issued in connection with the Share
Consolidation. All fractional shares will be rounded up to the whole number of shares. Immediately following the Share Consolidation,
the authorized share capital of the Company will be US$3,125,000 divided into 150,000,000 ordinary shares, par value $0.01875 per share
and 16,666,666.6666 preferred shares, par value $0.01875 per share.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><B>About Universe Pharmaceuticals
INC</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">Universe Pharmaceuticals
INC, headquartered in Ji&rsquo;an, Jiangxi, China, is a pharmaceutical producer and distributor in China. The Company specializes in the
manufacturing, marketing, sales and distribution of traditional Chinese medicine derivatives products targeting the elderly with the goal
of addressing their physical conditions in the aging process and to promote their general well-being. The Company also distributes and
sells biomedical drugs, medical instruments, Traditional Chinese Medicine Pieces, and dietary supplements manufactured by third-party
pharmaceutical companies. Currently, the Company&rsquo;s products are sold in 30 provinces of China. For more information, visit the company&rsquo;s
website at http://www.universe-pharmacy.com/.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><B><I>Forward-Looking
Statements</I></B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&nbsp;</P>

